# ==============================================================================
# AI Agent Ignore File (.agentignore)
# Protects secrets & token budget by excluding noisy, generated, or sensitive files
# ==============================================================================

# Secrets & Credentials (NEVER upload to LLMs)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/secrets.json
**/credentials.json

# Dependencies & Package Managers
**/node_modules/**
**/vendor/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/env/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**

# Build Outputs & Generated Artifacts
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/.nuxt/**
**/.svelte-kit/**
**/out/**
**/target/**
**/bin/**
**/obj/**

# Version Control & Metadata
**/.git/**
**/.svn/**
**/.hg/**

# Logs, Cache & Dumps
**/*.log
**/*.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/poetry.lock
**/Cargo.lock
**/coverage/**
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/**
**/*.dmp
**/*.core
